      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tracy_City%2C_Tennessee",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Swiss settler Christian Marugg founded the Marugg Company in 1873, and its European‑style scythes remain a local craft on the National Register.",
